~ start
do Gs._stop()
Narrator: You need go to meeting room
set Gs.event = "meeting"
do Gs._play()
=> END

~ meet
do Gs._stop()
Security guard: The New Year is coming soon!
Director: No!
Richard: What's "no"?
Director: No one will get the award!
Guard: And why?
Deputy Director: Because we have only 4 million allocated for the implementation of the plan, and we cannot spend it on bonuses and salaries.
Analyst: 4 million?! Not 2?!
Secretary: 2 million?! Not a million?!
Economist: a million?! Not 500 thousand?!
manager: 500 thousand?! Not 200?!
Richard: Was money allocated for this?!
* And silence...*
=> end_meet
=> END

~ end_meet
Narrator: That's the end of the meeting, and the assignment for today is on your screen.
do Gs._play()
do vis()
=> END